{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 3970,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm in Pascagoula, Mississippi, and I'm here\nto meet with Calvin Parker, who is involved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the 1973 UFO abduction case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12400,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Calvin's story was met with such skepticism\nand ridicule that he spent the rest of his"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16810,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life in hiding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17890,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's barely spoken about what happened that\nnight in more than 30 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22330,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He still lives here in the area, and I'm\nreally excited to talk with him about all the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28270,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "details because I understand it really\nimpacted his life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31750,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice to meet you. Come on in. Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33220,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you. Happy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34240,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm honored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35320,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why not? Pleasure to meet you as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37570,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Calvin's wife, Wynette, has avoided the\ncameras since the abduction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41620,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, she's agreed to make an exception\nfor Ben."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44770,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is how long you lived here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46930,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since right after Katrina."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49780,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Never would use my real name to my\nneighbors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52540,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? They didn't find out who I was till\nlast year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55660,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you serious? I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56950,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How long did you use the other name for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59020,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "45 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61040,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "45 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63690,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wyanet, is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64800,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So you, I understand, were with him\nfrom the beginning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69450,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were engaged when this happened?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72360,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, This happened in October."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74400,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we was engaged to get married in\nNovember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76980,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the first time Wynette has ever gone\non the record with her account of Calvin's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81480,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ordeal. Until now, she's been wary of\ntelling her story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85350,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did that impact you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86460,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was very difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88110,
    "dDurationMs": 7020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how I knew something bad, tremendously\nbad, had happened to him for the first two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95130,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "months after all this happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98160,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His mouth quivered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100590,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it was like a nervous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102840,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he had never done that before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111230,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Calvin, I know that you didn't want to talk\nabout this for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115190,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's probably still hard for you, but can\nyou take me back to that night and just kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120290,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of walk me through step by step what\nhappened?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122690,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely. We got off around 5:00 that\nevening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126930,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We parked and walked down to the pier and\nthat's when I noticed coming from behind me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132750,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was some hazy blue lights like the\npatrol cars used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138880,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was thinking, oh, boy, we fixing to go\nto jail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142960,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We turned around about the same time and\nlooked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147450,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was three bulky looking creatures coming\ntoward us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153500,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They was grey in colour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156290,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had skin that kind of looked like an\nelephant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160670,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one grab made by the left arm and I\nautomatically felt an injection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166850,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It paralyzed me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168080,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could roll my eyes, but that's all I can\nmove."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175620,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176570,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Took us toward this craft in this big, ugly\ncreature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181670,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take me toward this table and laid me at a\n45 degree angle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189390,
    "dDurationMs": 8040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I felt this presence coming in and\nit's what I call a female."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197460,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her two middle fingers was a little bit\nlonger on each hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201480,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then she grabbed my chin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204000,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She took. Her two middle fingers from this\nother hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207280,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She ran them down my throat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212960,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I started choking and bleeding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215440,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's when I noticed how they look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217480,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't nothing like I've never seen in\nthis world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220360,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This other thing come alive like a jack in\nthe box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223570,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he got me by the left arm and I felt\nthis injection again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228990,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He carried me out to the riverbank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232830,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is when I remember hearing Charlie\nsay, Son, Son, you okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242230,
    "dDurationMs": 5850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometime. I feel like I've had people tell\nme that they was angels that was cast out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248080,
    "dDurationMs": 6970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heaven. And I don't believe that if I was\ngoing to make an educated guess about it that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255050,
    "dDurationMs": 5070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had to be from another galaxy or planet\nor something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260120,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And traveling by."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261870,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not from this world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263840,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, they're not from this world, I guarantee\nyou that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270400,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. Absolutely incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273970,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you notice anything?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275800,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were there eyes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276910,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ears?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277570,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't notice anything about your face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280450,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the arms?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281710,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their hands looked like they had mittens on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284500,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or I call them crab like hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286660,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so the hands were kind of like\npinchers, but the female had a sharp claw."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291580,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294520,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a drawing from Dr."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296320,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hynek's Project Blue book file that was\nrendered from Charles and Calvin's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300190,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "descriptions. This is the first time\nCalvin's ever seen it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304120,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would you say that this looked anything like\nwhat you had seen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308860,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entities that brought you on board?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310540,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, this is similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314470,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next pretty close to right in the hands\nis pretty close to right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318040,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, the. And his arms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320470,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The arms was just a little bit longer in\nproportion with the body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324990,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. So did you guys call the cops?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327940,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I said, look, best thing for us to do\nis not tell nobody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332160,
    "dDurationMs": 7110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Charles called Jackson County Sheriff\ndepartment, and he started to tell them what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339270,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happened. And I was thinking, what a idiot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341370,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, two patrolmen come pulling up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344850,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Him and his deputy put us in a car and took\nus to the Keesler Air Force Base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353610,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We got to the gate and they escorted his own\nend to the back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361590,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were six men dressed in hazmat suits,\ntold everybody else to step back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367050,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step away from us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371660,
    "dDurationMs": 6450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when they opened them doors, they had\never law enforcement in the three counties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378110,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down here and they said, we need for y'all\nto tell us what happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383460,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I said, Well, let Charlie tell you, he's\ngood running his mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386480,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so Charlie told the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390650,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She said that I was a kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392420,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was honest to God, you only saw three me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394880,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when you follow me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396080,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I seen three things of funny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399590,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't have a mouth like we do, and it\nlooked like open under their nose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404630,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throughout the entire interrogation, neither\nCalvin nor Charlie changed their story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409430,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The evidence that both men were telling the\ntruth was overwhelming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412910,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after their interviews, Charles and\nCalvin were simply dismissed with no follow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417230,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417980,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They took us back and we went on back to\nCharlie's apartment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was renting a room from him, and I went\ninto my room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425900,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just walked in the door and I took all my\nclothes off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429440,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I got in the shower and they was a\ngallon of bleach in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434010,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I turned the hot water on as hot as I\ncould stand it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439650,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I took that gallon of bleach and I\npoured it all over my head and I rubbed it in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444600,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all over my body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446640,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I figured that would kill any germs or\nanything I had on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454410,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would violate. It'd be a good word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456510,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I do feel violated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459390,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's affected me even up to this date\nbecause I've never really trusted a lot of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467070,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people."
    } ]
  } ]
}
